@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
allowmixing
title Template example — Domain model: entities, values and aggregate candidates
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class ResumeDraft <<entity / candidate root>>
class ResumeId <<value object>>
class DraftVersion <<value object>>
class ConfirmedSelection <<value object>>
class PublishedResumeRevision <<immutable entity>>
class SubmissionMaterialSet <<Applications entity>>
ResumeDraft --> ResumeId
ResumeDraft --> DraftVersion
ResumeDraft --> ConfirmedSelection
PublishedResumeRevision ..> ResumeDraft : snapshot provenance, not mutable navigation
SubmissionMaterialSet ..> PublishedResumeRevision : optional provenance

@enduml
